OL,3,GNEWSAFerry sailings suspended after
OL,4,Aengine failure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassenger sailings between Jersey and
OL,7,FGuernsey have been suspended after a
OL,8,Fmajor technical failure on the MV San
OL,9,FPawl's starboard main engine.
OL,11,FOperator Islands Unlimited said
OL,12,Fservices would not run until further
OL,13,Fnotice while engineers carried out a
OL,14,Ffull assessment of the vessel and
OL,15,Fworked to establish the extent of the
OL,16,Ffault.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
