OL,3,GNEWSAFerry sailings suspended after
OL,4,Aengine failure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe San Pawl is used for foot passenger
OL,7,Fcrossings between the islands and
OL,8,Fearlier this year successfully
OL,9,Fcompleted trials to test whether it
OL,10,Fcould also operate services to
OL,11,FAlderney.
OL,13,FThe company said the suspension had
OL,14,Fbeen introduced to ensure the safety of
OL,15,Fpassengers, crew and the vessel.
